==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Neutralization Type Nimue (Enemy)|Neutralization Type Nimue]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~53.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 6.67~53.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 6.67~53.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 6.67~53.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has a similar level of difficulty to [[Excalibur]], however the Shy Boys may prove to be a bit of a nuisance. [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] can easily resolve that issue.

